      {
       "id": "0a5817c6",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">MXRP are a Sunny Coast based motocross performance specialist. As with most businesses, working on expensive performance bikes takes a certain level of trust from the customer. Daniel from MXRP needed a way to instil confidence in his work and his team to potential clients.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">Personality, expertise and professionalism are best shown through video and so we set out to create a campaign for MXRP. As with most shoots, we also made the most of being on site and captured loads of high-resolution stills for MXRP to use on their website and social media.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">It was a pleasure to capture Daniel and the MXRP team and we at Pepper look forward to working with them in the future!</p>",
        "text_color": "#55575C",
        "typography_typography": "custom",
        "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
        "typography_font_size": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 16
        },
        "typography_line_height": {
         "unit": "px",
